"lines": [
{
"text": "Sara, Abram\u2019s wife, bore no children.",
"start": 12.321,
"end": 15.801
},
{
"text": "She had an Egyptian maid named Agar.",
"start": 16.661,
"end": 19.481
},
{
"text": "Sara said to Abram, \u201cThe Lord has kept me",
"start": 20.461,
"end": 23.962
},
{
"text": "from having children. Go to my maid,",
"start": 24.802,
"end": 27.942
},
{
"text": "so I may have children through her.\u201d",
"start": 29.322,
"end": 32.702
},
{
"text": "Abram listened to Sara.",
"start": 37.423,
"end": 39.103
},
{
"text": "After Abram had lived ten years in Chanaan,",
"start": 40.443,
"end": 44.143
},
{
"text": "Sara took Agar the Egyptian, her maid,",
"start": 44.383,
"end": 48.444
},
{
"text": "and gave her to Abram as his wife.",
"start": 48.604,
"end": 51.664
},
{
"text": "He went in to Agar, and she conceived.",
"start": 56.864,
"end": 59.484
},
{
"text": "When she knew she was pregnant,",
"start": 60.424,
"end": 63.485
},
{
"text": "she looked down on her mistress.",
"start": 64.485,
"end": 67.885
},
{
"text": "Sara said to Abram, \u201cThis wrong is your fault.",
"start": 68.265,
"end": 72.925
},
{
"text": "I gave my maid to you, and now that she is pregnant,",
"start": 76.826,
"end": 81.066
},
{
"text": "I am dishonored before her. Let the Lord judge",
"start": 81.986,
"end": 87.946
},
{
"text": "between you and me.\u201d",
"start": 88.426,
"end": 91.667
},
{
"text": "Abram said to Sara, \u201cYour maid is in your hands.",
"start": 93.907,
"end": 97.407
},
{
"text": "Treat her as you think best.\u201d",
"start": 97.527,
"end": 99.987
},
{
"text": "Sara afflicted Agar, and she fled from her.",
"start": 101.087,
"end": 108.588
},
{
"text": "The Lord\u2019s angel found her by a spring",
"start": 120.589,
"end": 123.709
},
{
"text": "in the wilderness, on the road to Sur.",
"start": 123.869,
"end": 127.449
},
{
"text": "The angel said, \u201cAgar, Sara\u2019s maid,",
"start": 127.629,
"end": 131.03
},
{
"text": "where have you come from, and where are you going?\u201d",
"start": 131.13,
"end": 135.53
},
{
"text": "She said, \u201cI am fleeing from my mistress Sara.\u201d",
"start": 135.71,
"end": 140.95
},
{
"text": "The Lord\u2019s angel said,",
"start": 143.731,
"end": 145.571
},
{
"text": "\u201cReturn to your mistress;",
"start": 147.411,
"end": 149.551
},
{
"text": "submit yourself under her hands.\u201d",
"start": 149.951,
"end": 153.271
},
{
"text": "The Lord\u2019s angel said,",
"start": 157.212,
"end": 159.132
},
{
"text": "\u201cI will greatly multiply your descendants;",
"start": 160.072,
"end": 163.772
},
{
"text": "they will be too many to count.\u201d",
"start": 163.972,
"end": 169.132
},
{
"text": "The Lord\u2019s angel said, \u201cYou are with child;",
"start": 172.233,
"end": 176.093
},
{
"text": "you will bear a son. Name him Ismael,",
"start": 176.173,
"end": 179.233
},
{
"text": "for the Lord has heard your humiliation.\u201d",
"start": 180.493,
"end": 184.634
},
{
"text": "\u201cHe will be a wild man;",
"start": 186.314,
"end": 188.194
},
{
"text": "his hands against all, all hands against him.",
"start": 189.134,
"end": 192.634
},
{
"text": "He will live before all his brothers.\u201d",
"start": 193.954,
"end": 197.934
},
{
"text": "She named the Lord God who spoke to her,",
"start": 203.875,
"end": 208.395
},
{
"text": "\u201cYou are God who sees me.\u201d",
"start": 208.995,
"end": 212.196
},
{
"text": "She said, \u201cI have openly seen",
"start": 212.996,
"end": 216.496
},
{
"text": "him who appeared to me.\u201d",
"start": 216.636,
"end": 219.836
},
{
"text": "She called it \u201cThe well of him",
"start": 220.616,
"end": 223.696
},
{
"text": "whom I have openly seen.\u201d",
"start": 225.236,
"end": 228.037
},
{
"text": "It lies between Cades and Barad.",
"start": 229.917,
"end": 234.117
},
{
"text": "Agar bore Abram a son,",
"start": 237.297,
"end": 239.498
},
{
"text": "and Abram named the boy Ismael.",
"start": 241.118,
"end": 244.338
},
{
"text": "Abram was eighty-six years old",
"start": 245.478,
"end": 249.158
},
{
"text": "when Agar bore Ismael to him.",
"start": 249.198,
"end": 252.418
}
],
